### Auth Feature UI Routes Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/auth

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/auth
@email = user@example.com
@password = password123
@name = John Doe
@verificationToken = your-verification-token-here
@resetToken = your-reset-token-here

### 1. User Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### 2. User Signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "password_confirmation": "{{password}}"
}

###

### 3. User Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Verify User Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/verify?token={{verificationToken}}

###

### 5. Get Current User Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Send Password Reset Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/password-reset-mail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

###

### 7. Reset Password with Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword123",
  "password_confirmation": "newpassword123",
  "token": "{{resetToken}}"
}

###

### 8. Google OAuth Callback
GET {{baseUrl}}/google/callback

###

### 9. Test Login with Invalid Credentials (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 10. Test Signup with Mismatched Passwords (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "password_confirmation": "differentpassword"
}

###

### 11. Test Signup with Invalid Email (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "password_confirmation": "{{password}}"
}

###
